Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Marblehead has a bright little\Nhigh-tide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.57,0:00:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,window today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.05,0:00:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Saturday November 14th.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Riverhead Beach looks best\Nfrom 1:00
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,PM to 3:30 PM, with sunny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,breaks, around 46 degrees, and\Na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,9 miles per hour breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you’re thinking paddle\Nboard, aim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.57,0:00:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,near the 2:07 PM high tide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,at 8.7 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Other tide marks: high at 2:05
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,AM, lows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,at 7:54 AM and 8:35
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.37,0:00:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool air, clean light, and a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,very usable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,beach stretch.
